  "body": "Mentioned in https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-permissions-policy/issues/552#issuecomment-2208480420, in order to consistently support documents which do not have HTTP headers (`about:srcdoc`, `about:blank`, `data:` and the like,) we should have support for permissions policy in the policy container. This should allow it to be properly cloned for such documents.",
